### 2016A&A...596A..75S: Characterizing elusive, faint dusty star-forming galaxies: a lensed, optically undetected ALMA galaxy at z 3.3 (2016; high_z_galaxies; archival_reuse)
- question: What are the physical properties (redshift, stellar mass, SFR, dust mass, magnification) of a serendipitously detected, optically undetected, lensed faint submm galaxy at z~3.3 in COSMOS, and is it representative of elusive dust-obscured s…
