  - fitting: chi2 minimisation template fit [Physical properties: "We fit the photometry from the I814 band to IRAC with the PEGASE 2.0 templates (cite: fioc97) using our own code *zphot.exe* (cite: fontana00; santini15)."]
  - validation: BC03 library gives z=3.25; FIR-radio SED of Yun & Carilli confirms z between 3 and 3.5 [5 Physical properties: "a value for the photometric redshift between 3 and 3.5 is also confirmed by the starburst FIR-radio SED of (cite: yun02)"]
